      "jp": "ある日のこと。\n夜の海岸を散歩していたオキシーさんと僕は、\n島に上陸しようとしていた侵入者たちに出くわした。",
      "jp_sha256": "d00ea4ddc43949c0cec628e9a323453c0677020fdacda42ab9a2c082586e01f8",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "어느 날.\n밤바다를 산책하던 옥시 씨와 나는,\n섬에 상륙하려던 침입자들과 마주쳤다.",
      "message_index_0based": 0,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 8,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b001-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "cdd17c8acda56714b5b262c8e8e088170ac1f79e506bb760988c3f7baa539dcf:000002_1062126575327023225:g0:r7",
      "row_index_0based": 7,
      "serialized_row_index": 7,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "ある日のこと。\n夜の海岸を散歩していたオキシーさんと僕は、\n島に上陸しようとしていた侵入者たちに出くわした。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "fd1cbee3b1f7de79fec95325fae58942befa36183f8dee3e54f59e708456ad6a",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 1,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "俺のシマに土足で踏み込んでくるたぁ、いい度胸だな！\nかかってこいや！　三枚に下ろして今夜の食卓に並べてやらぁ！",
      "jp_sha256": "b2eee445f1a72f5bf16c235e60b5cf2b6f7640acb50ca8815b69c771fb13065c",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "내 구역에 신발 신고 쳐들어오다니 배짱 한번 좋구나!\n덤벼! 회를 떠서 오늘 저녁 식탁에 올려주마!",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 28,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b001-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "cdd17c8acda56714b5b262c8e8e088170ac1f79e506bb760988c3f7baa539dcf:000002_1062126575327023225:g0:r27",
