      "serialized_row_index": 27,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "オキシー",
        "Emt2_Ang",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "俺のシマに土足で踏み込んでくるたぁ、いい度胸だな！\nかかってこいや！　三枚に下ろして今夜の食卓に並べてやらぁ！",
        "",
        "ch_10007/R18/10007B0_10007_Nml/10007B0_10007_001",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "オキシー",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": "ch_10007/R18/10007B0_10007_Nml/10007B0_10007_001"
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "1b01b241d55e86cf909e7d2416453fc5c71bbd122e6db99f730888c147be08c1",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 2,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ひぃっ、なんて狂暴なモンスター娘なんだ！\nきっと他のモンスターも\n頭からバリバリ食ってるに違いないっ……！",
      "jp_sha256": "dbe658b4a0ed174b5056d453a890f2fe456aa4a8ea949cf2a3bce078eacdbad4",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "히익, 무슨 몬스터 소녀가 이렇게 흉폭해!\n분명 다른 몬스터들도\n머리부터 우적우적 씹어 먹었을 거야……!",
      "message_index_0based": 2,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 29,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b001-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "cdd17c8acda56714b5b262c8e8e088170ac1f79e506bb760988c3f7baa539dcf:000002_1062126575327023225:g0:r28",
      "row_index_0based": 28,
      "serialized_row_index": 28,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "侵入者",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "ひぃっ、なんて狂暴なモンスター娘なんだ！\nきっと他のモンスターも\n頭からバリバリ食ってるに違いないっ……！"
      ],
      "speaker": "侵入者",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "4003ab05b3a2b9f911dad42b5d7ccae92cf3534588c6c945e6a587a75001d701",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 3,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "あ、アタシらの装備じゃ勝てるわけがない！\nここは退散だ！　さっさと逃げるわよ！",
      "jp_sha256": "ac6168878c7507a9530fb1fc644965e5a2424e8a126fea03c250b82cd6a001bc",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "우, 우리 장비로는 이길 수가 없어!\n여긴 물러나자! 어서 도망쳐!",
      "message_index_0based": 3,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 30,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
