      "row_index_0based": 67,
      "serialized_row_index": 67,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "恥ずかしそうに言葉遣いを変えるオキシーさん。\n初めて出会った時からこんな感じなので、\n僕は彼女の様子にはもう慣れていた。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "cee42eb092a353dd6598d644eb03f9c432bb084c07f244f9afa25e5c438db965",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 9,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "オキシーさん、無理に上品な言葉を使わなくていいんですよ。\n別に威勢のいい口調でも、僕は嫌いになったりしませんから。",
      "jp_sha256": "a73f95193cc4af79a5b8f79bba7f298148fa2f3fe872ccbc8504d9d890253ca3",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "옥시 씨, 억지로 품위 있는 말을 쓰지 않아도 돼요.\n씩씩한 말투를 써도 제가 싫어하지 않으니까요.",
      "message_index_0based": 9,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 69,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b001-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "cdd17c8acda56714b5b262c8e8e088170ac1f79e506bb760988c3f7baa539dcf:000002_1062126575327023225:g0:r68",
      "row_index_0based": 68,
      "serialized_row_index": 68,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "オキシーさん、無理に上品な言葉を使わなくていいんですよ。\n別に威勢のいい口調でも、僕は嫌いになったりしませんから。"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "d262f60f57978851807c8a6c1dfbd798990108a386bef9c1413701c0c1037423",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 10,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ありがとうございます、だーりん。\nでも、無理をしているわけではないんですよ。\nなんていうか……癖みたいなもので。",
      "jp_sha256": "cde3502ea6c1d18096e3621ecf1b8d471fee22645df1dc322fb83fe1060ad60f",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "고마워요, 달링.\n하지만 억지로 그러는 건 아니에요.\n뭐랄까…… 버릇 같은 거라서요.",
      "message_index_0based": 10,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 70,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
